Read `/AGENTS.md` and `/docs/contracts/DATA_AND_EVENTS.md` before making any edits.
Identify your stream (`A`: Backend in `docs/tasks/STREAM_A_BACKEND.md`, `B`: 3D Viewport in `docs/tasks/STREAM_B_3D_VIEWPORT.md`, `C`: UI in `docs/tasks/STREAM_C_COLLAB_UI.md`).
Never duplicate business rules outside `@spriter/shared`.
Always run `npm run verify` to validate architecture boundaries and unit tests before completing your turn.
